{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17756","headline":"冬夜陪丘侍御先辈听崔校书弹琴 · 杨巨源","name":"冬夜陪丘侍御先辈听崔校书弹琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪满中庭月映林，谢家幽赏在瑶琴。\n楚妃波浪天南远，蔡女烟沙漠北深。\n顾盼何曾因误曲，殷勤终是感知音。\n若将雅调开诗兴，未抵丘迟一片心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}